        "summary": "Add a rule",
        "security": [
          {
            "session": []
          },
          {
            "apiToken": []
          },
          {
            "adminToken": []
          }
        ],
        "description": "Sigma YAML or JSON. Supported: selections of fields with the modifiers contains, startswith, endswith, re and all; keyword lists; conditions with and, or, not, parentheses, `1 of`, `any of` and `all of` over names, patterns and `them`. Aggregations and timeframes are refused with a message.\n\nNeeds the admin role.",
